  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145456",
      "title": "Navigating To Dynamic Routes",
      "lectureOrder": 239,
      "videoOrder": 223,
      "sourceHash": "0f66ee6bb41822d70d252c369706f1aa111f3dc457f8c136a554750c0daacb48",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.35,
          "end": 4.95,
          "en": "So to navigate to dynamic pages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.95,
          "end": 7.9,
          "en": "we can still use this link component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.9,
          "end": 10.393,
          "en": "which we import from next/link.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.41,
          "end": 13.36,
          "en": "We use it just as before, so here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.36,
          "end": 15.91,
          "en": "again, we can add an unordered list,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.91,
          "end": 18.716,
          "en": "and add the link component, and then say",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.716,
          "end": 22.52,
          "en": "our first client is Maximilian.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.52,
          "end": 26.36,
          "en": "And here, the ID of that client could max.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.36,
          "end": 28.42,
          "en": "So, therefore we can simply set this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.42,
          "end": 33.42,
          "en": "to /clients/max, for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.48,
          "end": 37.29,
          "en": "And then, this simply is taken as a concrete value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.29,
          "end": 40.333,
          "en": "for this ID here in the square brackets.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.58,
          "end": 43.96,
          "en": "And, of course, we can have a second client here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 43.96,
          "end": 47.493,
          "en": "let's say Manuel, where the ID then could be manu.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 49.93,
          "end": 53.82,
          "en": "And if we save that and have a look at our clients page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.82,
          "end": 56.42,
          "en": "now we can click on Maximilian to be taken",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 56.42,
          "end": 59.68,
          "en": "to the overview page with all the projects",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 59.68,
          "end": 63.46,
          "en": "for this client, for max as you can see here on the right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 63.46,
          "end": 66.51,
          "en": "Or if I click on Manuel, I go to the same page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 66.51,
          "end": 70.44,
          "en": "but with a value of manu for that ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 70.44,
          "end": 72.52,
          "en": "So, that's how this works and how we can,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.52,
          "end": 76.793,
          "en": "of course, also navigate to pages with dynamic parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.66,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "Now, in reality, you often need to generate",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 82.48,
          "en": "a list like this dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.48,
          "end": 84.28,
          "en": "So, you might have some piece of data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 84.28,
          "end": 87.32,
          "en": "let's say, a clients array here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.32,
          "end": 89.98,
          "en": "And every client is an object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.98,
          "end": 94.97999999999999,
          "en": "with an ID of max and a name of Maximilian.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 97.41,
          "end": 100.14699999999999,
          "en": "And then, we have another client here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 101.169,
          "end": 104.50200000000001,
          "en": "with a name of Manuel and an ID of manu.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.61,
          "end": 107.36,
          "en": "So, what I already have down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 107.36,
          "end": 108.86,
          "en": "But, in reality, you would, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.86,
          "end": 111.69,
          "en": "often get such data from a database, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.69,
          "end": 114.72999999999999,
          "en": "and you want to generate that dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.72999999999999,
          "end": 117.11,
          "en": "You can do this as well just as you know it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 117.11,
          "end": 121.24,
          "en": "from standard React because this is standard React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 121.24,
          "end": 124.74,
          "en": "Inside of this component, it is a standard React component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.74,
          "end": 127.16,
          "en": "nothing special about that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.16,
          "end": 130.4,
          "en": "So, therefore, we can map our clients",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.4,
          "end": 132.97,
          "en": "to list items just as we know it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.97,
          "end": 135.92,
          "en": "Set a key, as we should to ensure that React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.92,
          "end": 138.93,
          "en": "is able to fully understand this list",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.93,
          "end": 141.21,
          "en": "and update this list efficiently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 141.21,
          "end": 144.21,
          "en": "And set this to client.id, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 144.21,
          "end": 146.93,
          "en": "since that is a unique identifier.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 146.93,
          "end": 150.07999999999998,
          "en": "And then, in the list item, we can use our link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.07999999999998,
          "end": 153.72,
          "en": "and between the link tags, output client.name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 153.72,
          "end": 157.55,
          "en": "and for the link set a ref, which we also set",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 157.55,
          "end": 160.26,
          "en": "to a dynamic value where we, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.26,
          "end": 165.2,
          "en": "use back ticks to create a template literal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 165.2,
          "end": 169.6,
          "en": "to set this POV to /clients/",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.6,
          "end": 173.653,
          "en": "and then inject a dynamic value here, which is client ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 175,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "So, with that, we render a bunch of list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 181.14,
          "en": "with a bunch of links where, inside of the link,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 181.14,
          "end": 183.42,
          "en": "is a text, which is visible to the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.42,
          "end": 186.29,
          "en": "we output the client name and as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.29,
          "end": 189.64,
          "en": "for the target for the destination of that link",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 189.64,
          "end": 193.08,
          "en": "we create a string with a template literal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 193.08,
          "end": 195.85,
          "en": "by having the hard coded /clients part.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 195.85,
          "end": 198.64,
          "en": "And then, the dynamically injected client ID,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 198.64,
          "end": 201.54,
          "en": "which is different for every client we're looping through.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 203.5,
          "end": 205.92000000000002,
          "en": "Hence, with that, if we save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 205.92000000000002,
          "end": 208.89,
          "en": "and we go back to our clients page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 208.89,
          "end": 212,
          "en": "it looks like before, and it works like before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 212,
          "end": 215.45,
          "en": "But now that list is generated dynamically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 215.45,
          "end": 219.09300000000002,
          "en": "And that works just as you know it from standard React.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
